  "fullDescription": "Step into the retro-futuristic world of Tegno, a bold Y2K font that captures the spirit of early 2000s digital culture. Designed with a techno-sci-fi aesthetic, this font boasts thick, blocky letterforms with stylized bevels and unexpected curves that give off a nostalgic yet futuristic vibe. The sharp edges and exaggerated terminals provide a cybernetic rhythm that feels right at home in digital realms, glitch art, rave flyers, and space-age branding. From bold display use to album artwork, Tegno delivers a striking visual identity that channels vaporwave flair, arcade nostalgia, and the bold irreverence of turn-of-the-millennium aesthetics.\n\nThe font’s color presentation in vibrant mint green and electric pink over a deep royal blue background reinforces its Y2K essence—evoking memories of early internet graphics and sci-fi packaging. Complete with uppercase, lowercase, numbers, and a robust set of symbols and punctuation, Tegno is optimized for both print and digital media. Ideal for tech startups, music labels, fashion packaging, or anything craving a burst of retro-futurism, this font is your gateway to creating visuals that feel both nostalgic and next-gen.",
